{"displayStem":"두 눈을 따로 검사한 결과가 그림과 같다. 음영은 반응이 소실된 영역이다. 시선 고정은 적절했고 망막 검사는 정상이었다. 정면에서 환자가 보는 시야의 좌우로 표시했다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"직접 설계한 교육용 모식도·합성 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C06 c06-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 자료 모식도\"><defs><marker id=\"c06arr\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 3.5L0 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path></marker><pattern id=\"c06hatch\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 8L8 0\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></pattern></defs><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"><text x=\"250\" y=\"25\" text-anchor=\"middle\">환자가 보는 시야 기준</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\">← 왼쪽                  오른쪽 →</text><path d=\"M135 170L60 170A75 75 0 0 1 135 95Z\" fill=\"url(#c06hatch)\"></path><circle cx=\"135\" cy=\"170\" r=\"75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"135\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"135\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\">왼눈</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+</text><path d=\"M365 170L290 170A75 75 0 0 1 365 95Z\" fill=\"url(#c06hatch)\"></path><circle cx=\"365\" cy=\"170\" r=\"75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"365\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"365\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\">오른눈</text><text x=\"365\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\">음영: 반응 소실 / +: 고정점</text></g></svg></div></div>"]}